; Test: COUNT with variable in template
; ======================================
;
; Demonstrates: Using $k variable in the report template
; Based on test from kernel/src/main.rs:1649

; Setup: Initial facts
(foo 1) (foo 2) (foo 3)
(bar x) (bar y)
(baz P) (baz Q) (baz R)

; Test: Count all combinations and use $k in report
(exec 0
  (, (foo $x) (bar $y) (baz $z))
  (O (count (all $k) $k (cux $z $y $x))))

; Expected output:
; (all 18)
;
; Explanation:
; - 3 foo values × 2 bar values × 3 baz values = 18 combinations
; - The count is bound to $k
; - Report template (all $k) becomes (all 18)
